msgstr "Space"

#: client/local_connection.cc
msgid "You're playing offline: the world is yours alone, and nothing is saved."
msgstr "Joc offline: lumea are un singur jucător și nu se salvează nimic."

#: client/local_connection.cc
msgid "The stories come from a server's storyteller, and there's none offline."
msgstr "Poveștile vin de la povestitorul unui server, iar offline nu e niciunul."

#: client/local_connection.cc
msgid "Guilds are kept by the servers, so there are none offline."
msgstr "Breslele sunt ținute de servere, așa că offline nu există."

#: client/local_connection.cc
msgid "A trade takes another player, and there's nobody else offline."
msgstr "Un schimb are nevoie de alt jucător, iar offline nu mai e nimeni."

#: client/local_connection.cc
msgid "A duel takes another player, and there's nobody else offline."
msgstr "Un duel are nevoie de alt jucător, iar offline nu mai e nimeni."

#: client/local_connection.cc
msgid "The gates lead to the servers' other lands, and there are none offline."
msgstr "Porțile duc spre celelalte ținuturi ale serverelor, iar offline nu există."

